  "description": "Reid Falco Jr | 24 inch junior road bike\nBuilt for young riders with a need for speed, the Reid Falco Jr 24\" is a performance-focused junior road bike designed specifically for growing riders. With road-ready features and junior-specific geometry, it delivers the feel and performance of a road bike in a compact, confidence-inspiring package.\nJunior-specific geometry and finishing kit provide a comfortable riding position, while drop handlebars help young riders develop their road cycling skills and technique. Powerful dual-pivot rim brakes deliver reliable stopping power for confident riding, cornering and descending.\nA Shimano Claris 16-speed drivetrain provides plenty of gearing for tackling climbs and faster road rides, while lightweight road-specific wheels and tyres help keep the bike easy to handle and efficient on the road.\nWhether they're joining family road rides, building their cycling skills or simply enjoying the freedom of riding faster, the Reid Falco Jr 24\" is designed to help young cyclists get more from every ride.\nWho is the Falco Jr for?\nThe Reid Falco Jr 24\" is ideal for:\n\nYoung riders ready for their first junior road bike\nJunior cyclists developing their road riding skills\nRiders looking for a lightweight 24\" road bike\nYoung cyclists who enjoy faster rides and longer distances\nRiders developing confidence with drop handlebars and road gearing\nFamily road rides, training and everyday cycling adventures\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps young riders ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on height and riding needs.",
